flowchart TD
    N[Number Theory] --> D[Divisibility]
    N --> M[Modular Arithmetic]
    N --> P[Prime Numbers]
    N --> C[Cryptography]

    D --> D1[Divisors / Multiples]
    D --> D2[GCD via Euclidean Algorithm]
    D --> D3[LCM]
    D --> D4[Extended Euclidean]

    M --> M1[Congruence Relations]
    M --> M2[Modular Inverse]
    M --> M3[Chinese Remainder Theorem]
    M --> M4[Fermat's Little Theorem]
    M --> M5[Euler's Totient & Theorem]

    P --> P1[Prime Factorization]
    P --> P2[Sieve of Eratosthenes]
    P --> P3[Primality Testing]
    P --> P4[Fundamental Theorem of Arithmetic]

    C --> C1[RSA Encryption]
    C --> C2[Diffie-Hellman Key Exchange]
    C --> C3[Discrete Logarithm]
